* "Organization" means any company, partnership, nonprofit, government body, school, or other entity, and also any sole proprietor or freelancer using the Software for professional or commercial purposes.
* "Personal Use" means use by an individual for private, non-commercial purposes.
* "Small Business" means an Organization employing no more than 100 individuals in total (a sole proprietor or freelancer with no employees is a Small Business).
* "Large Enterprise" means an Organization employing more than 100 individuals in total.
* "Internal Use" means use exclusively within an authorized individual or Organization's own operations, without distribution to external parties.
* "Modification" means any alteration, adaptation, improvement, or derivative work based on the Software.

For employee-count purposes, Organizations under common control shall be considered together. Employees include full-time and part-time personnel, but not independent contractors who are genuinely operating independently.

